---@field failureThreshold? number|distilled.Null Minimum consecutive failures for the probe to be considered failed after having succeeded. Defaults to 3. Minimum value is 1.
---@field initialDelaySeconds? number|distilled.Null Number of seconds after the container has started before liveness probes are initiated.
---@field path? string|distilled.Null Path to access to check for readiness
---@field periodSeconds? number|distilled.Null How often (in seconds) to perform the probe. Default to 10 seconds. Minimum value is 1.
---@field port? number|distilled.Null Port to access to check for readiness
---@field successThreshold? number|distilled.Null Minimum consecutive successes for the probe to be considered successful after having failed. Defaults to 1. Must be 1 for liveness and startup. Minimum value is 1.
---@field timeoutSeconds? number|distilled.Null Number of seconds after which the probe times out. Defaults to 1 second. Minimum value is 1.

